{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"805","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. 3-palindrome"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the beginning of the new year Keivan decided to reverse his name. He doesn't like palindromes, so he changed Naviek to Navick."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"He is too selfish, so for a given "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" he wants to obtain a string of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" characters, each of which is either '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' or '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', with no "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"palindromes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of length "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" appearing in the string as a substring. For example, the strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abc"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abca"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" suit him, while the string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" doesn't. He also want the number of letters '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' in his string to be as little as possible."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains single integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 2·105"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the length of the string."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the string that satisfies all the constraints."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there are multiple answers, print any of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"aa\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"bba\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"palindrome"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is a sequence of characters which reads the same backward and forward."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"805B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/805/problem/B"}